{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"151049017":{"pageid":151049017,"ns":6,"title":"File:50 cool new things you can now do with KBs collection highlights - WikidataCon 30102021 OlafJanssen Online.webm","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":67229803,"width":640,"height":360,"duration":1283.045,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/50_cool_new_things_you_can_now_do_with_KBs_collection_highlights_-_WikidataCon_30102021_OlafJanssen_Online.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:50_cool_new_things_you_can_now_do_with_KBs_collection_highlights_-_WikidataCon_30102021_OlafJanssen_Online.webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=151049017","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2024-08-01 15:42:29","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"50 cool new things you can now do with KBs collection highlights - WikidataCon 30102021 OlafJanssen Online","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Videos from YouTube|Self-published work|Olaf Janssen|GLAM at Koninklijke Bibliotheek - Videos|WikidataCon 2021 presentations","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"This video is a guided tour through the 5 articles of the series <b><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://kbnlwikimedia.github.io/KBCollectionHighlights/stories/Cool%20new%20things%20you%20can%20now%20do%20with%20the%20KB's%20collection%20highlights/\">50 cool new things you can now do with KB\u2019s collection highlights</a></b>\n<p>You will gain a better understanding of\n</p>\n<ol><li>that the Wikimedia infrastructure (= the combination of Wikidata, Wikimedia Commons and Wikipedia) offers a coherent, free, unlimited, sustainable, publicly accessible and participative 'LEGO box' with which any GLAM can improve the reusability of its collections at very limited costs &amp; resources.</li>\n<li>how they can use this LEGO box  to add new functionalities to their GLAM collections,</li>\n<li>that these 'new cool things' apply to both human (frond end, GUI) and machine (back end, SPARQL, API) users.</li></ol>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:50_cool_new_things_you_can_now_do_with_KBs_collection_highlights_-_WikidataCon_30102021_OlafJanssen_Online.pdf\" title=\"File:50 cool new things you can now do with KBs collection highlights - WikidataCon 30102021 OlafJanssen Online.pdf\">Presentation used in this video</a> (Wikimedia Commons)</li>\n<li>Same video of Youtube: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDsujh1CYUU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDsujh1CYUU</a></li>\n<li>Outline: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20211102112548/https://pretalx.com/wdcon21/talk/review/AB78GBGUTDVY788QHQ3NUPJEEQFLBF9B\">https://web.archive.org/web/20211102112548/https://pretalx.com/wdcon21/talk/review/AB78GBGUTDVY788QHQ3NUPJEEQFLBF9B</a></li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:50_cool_new_things_you_can_now_do_with_KBs_collection_highlights_-_WikidataCon_30102021_OlafJanssen_Online.pdf\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/50_cool_new_things_you_can_now_do_with_KBs_collection_highlights_-_WikidataCon_30102021_OlafJanssen_Online.pdf/page1-250px-50_cool_new_things_you_can_now_do_with_KBs_collection_highlights_-_WikidataCon_30102021_OlafJanssen_Online.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https